    oa:canonical true ;
    oa:eventKind oa:Observed ;
    oa:note "\"As early as the 9th century A.T an atypical radiation signature from the system was detected.\" At the time interpreted as Diamond Belt megastructure construction, an interpretation the article does not confirm; polity left blank. Diamond Belt is not on the roster, see unplaced. The radiation signature that led to the system being noticed; the article names no observer." ;
